    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af6dcfe14d01a26f8a95e29</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:53:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年格林落地了一个大项目——举办了自己的跨国婚礼！🌍💍 这一期我们就来聊聊这场婚礼，和大家分享这份美好～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:00:33</a>  格林笑得最多的一天</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">00:04:31</a>  备婚体验：在"花钱的肉疼"和"对婚礼的期待"之间反复横跳🤸‍♀️</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">00:13:06</a>  婚礼当天：新娘视角 vs 客人视角</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">00:21:45</a> 婚礼开始啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">00:32:45</a> 谁也没想到的惊喜，泪目了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2519">00:41:59</a> 婚礼结束了</span></p><p><span>🎵 本期配乐：Sweety《樱花草》</span></p>]]></description>
